@ 0 8 0 18d050a497243d08041c16ce2aa1c492
+         错误 `↯/s.97.1`：_`version` is not a valid semantic version because …_，原因为以下四种之一：`BadFormat`（_the string did not match the SemVer 2.0 grammar_，例如 `1.2` 或 `1.2.3.4`）、`EmptyIdentifier`（_a prerelease or build identifier was empty_，如 `1.2.3-`）、`LeadingZero`（_a numeric identifier had a leading zero_，如 `01.1.1` 或 `1.2.3-0123`）和 `InvalidCharacter`（_an identifier contained a character outside `[0-9A-Za-z-]`_）。
+         由 `Semver.decodable` 抛出；`v"…"` 字面量则将同样的问题报告为编译错误。
+     entry .Reason   文本不是语义化版本的原因：格式错误、空标识符、前导零或非法字符

